schema: resource
object:
  title: GitBook
  type: resource
  resource_type: hosted-docs
  url: https://www.gitbook.com/pricing
  link_status: active
  notes: >-
    Hosted docs platform with GitHub/GitLab sync; has a free tier and is free
    for open-source and nonprofit projects, but custom domains and team
    collaborators require a paid plan. Named as fine for a polished public
    handbook — the article's caution is to check the paywall boundary before
    depending on a feature that lives behind it.
  related_concepts:
